  "ingredients": [
    "parchment paper",
    "1 large russet potato, scrubbed",
    "2 tablespoons canola oil",
    "salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aFATd7xWqFdWqh0vqo4v53hkZTM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-step-01-5acf58906e98450da2f71fc511622926.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold a piece of parchment paper into eighths, paper airplane-style. Place the tip of the folded parchment in the center of a microwave-safe plate and measure the radius; cut remaining parchment off and unfold into a circle to fit the plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-KnAj5vfD7ecH2ipstHA-moiuYY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-step-02-6b268a545f824283806f5498e16d1f33.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice potato thinly using a mandolin and transfer to a bowl of cold water; rinse off as much starch as possible. Transfer potato slices to a clean kitchen towel to dry; blot tops as well to ensure they are as dry as possible.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H62EJlp_9luPo9KDDIWKNW3OO8M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-step-03-28ada2b1a77942cea8b197774ebe6900.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush some oil over the parchment paper. Working in batches, place as many potato slices on the oiled parchment that will fit; brush tops of slices with more oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Iiimop3F7yLPt_toerFYx-y0Lsg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-step-04-29726d0291c34b4bb918e857a6b2cdaa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in a microwave for 3 ½ minutes. Flip and continue to cook until browned and stiff, about 4 minutes more, checking the appearance often to make sure they don't burn.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KuTkOXgBTaBDSrR1sRDjwn5Vsyk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-step-06-bcc21443f9164a96a4b3bb56ca493510.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chips to a cold plate and season with salt. Let cool before serving. Continue with remaining potato slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lvICHdhEAA6SkNwADU7Vvf38sxA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8448214-microwave-potato-chips-VAT-4X3-f9ac2579f46f48eabdf138637a349104.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8448214/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
